%% title: Deploy, step 3 of 3: Flux applies and Flagger switches traffic
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Flux
    participant O as ghcr
    participant K as API server
    participant FG as Flagger
    participant S as Delivery
    participant CI as deploy job
    S->>F: call the Project's Receiver after the Publication point
    F->>O: pull the prod tag, verify its signature
    F->>K: apply the chain of Kustomizations, one per Apply group
    S->>K: watch, read-only: Kustomizations, Canaries, Events, inventoried objects
    FG->>S: Release Gate webhook
    S-->>FG: promote once every member is healthy
    S-->>CI: Operation stream: Serving, Held, Superseded or Observation lost
